# IMPORTANT:
# The following inputs are intentionally version controlled:
# 1. data/raw/Extended_Employee_Performance_and_Productivity_Data.csv
#    Canonical raw benchmark dataset preserved under LF normalization.
# 2. data/processed/split_registry.csv
#    Defines the frozen development/holdout partition and CV folds used
#    consistently across all model workflows.

# Local review manifests and requirements
REVIEW_MANIFEST.md
REVIEW_REQUIREMENTS.txt
REVIEW_*
